    [
     1,
     "<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Hi Ahmed-<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">With the latest version of ggplot2, opts() and theme_?() are out of date, or <i>deprecated</i>. Use the replacements the messages suggest: replace “opt” in your code with “theme”, and replace “theme_text” with “element_text”.  Should work…the book was based on earlier versions of the package.<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">cheers,<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Lori<u></u><u></u></span></p></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><div><div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #b5c4df 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0in 0in 0in\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a> [mailto:<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a>] <b>On Behalf Of </b>El-Tahtawy, Ahmed<br><b>Sent:</b> Friday, November 09, 2012 3:28 PM<br><b>To:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a><br><b>Subject:</b> Facet_grid<u></u><u></u></span></p></div></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Dear all,<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">The code in Page 123 of ggplot2 book gives me the following warning-<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">  <u></u><u></u></p><table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"917\" style=\"width:688.1pt\"><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 5.45pt 4.1pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Warning messages:<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">1: &#39;opts&#39; is deprecated.<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Use &#39;theme&#39; instead.<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">See help(&quot;Deprecated&quot;) <u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">2: &#39;theme_text&#39; is deprecated.<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Use &#39;element_text&#39; instead.<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">See help(&quot;Deprecated&quot;) <u></u><u></u></p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 5.45pt 4.1pt\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0in 0in 5.45pt 4.1pt\"></td></tr></table><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">mpg3 &lt;- within(mpg2,{<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">  model &lt;- reorder(model,cty)<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">  manufacturer &lt;-reorder(manufacturer, -cty)<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">})<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">models &lt;- qplot(cty,model,data=mpg3)<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">models + facet_grid(manufacturer ~ . , scales=&quot;free_Y&quot;,space=&quot;free&quot;)+ opts (strip.text.y=theme_text())<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">tried different tricks, to no avail!! Your help is appreciated.<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:&quot;Vladimir Script&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:&quot;Vladimir Script&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Best Regards</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:&quot;Vladimir Script&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Ahmed</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p></div></div>"
