     1,
     "<div>To supplement what Lori and Brandon said, the changes in v0.9 are described well in the &quot;guide-col.pdf&quot; document found here: <a href=\"https://github.com/hadley/ggplot2/downloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/hadley/ggplot2/downloads&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792374104814000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1_gBg_1PPA3dQQBSsO2VJf\">https://github.com/hadley/ggplot2/downloads</a>.  Even if you simply do the substitutions for the old syntax and your present code works, you should still read the document so the other changes don&#39;t trip you up later.  -Will</div>"
    ]
   ]
