    [
     3,
     "<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\"><div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #b5c4df 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"> Lori Sutter [mailto:<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">lsu...@vims.edu</a>]\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Saturday, November 10, 2012 8:34 AM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> El-Tahtawy, Ahmed; <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> RE: Facet_grid<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Hi Ahmed-<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">With the latest version of ggplot2, opts() and theme_?() are out of date, or\r\n<i>deprecated</i>. Use the replacements the messages suggest: replace “opt” in your code with “theme”, and replace “theme_text” with “element_text”.  Should work…the book was based on earlier versions of the package.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">cheers,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Lori<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #b5c4df 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a> [mailto:<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a>]\r\n<b>On Behalf Of </b>El-Tahtawy, Ahmed<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Friday, November 09, 2012 3:28 PM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> Facet_grid<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Dear all,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">The code in Page 123 of ggplot2 book gives me the following warning-<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">  <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"917\" style=\"width:688.1pt\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 5.45pt 4.1pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Warning messages:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">1: &#39;opts&#39; is deprecated.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Use &#39;theme&#39; instead.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">See help(&quot;Deprecated&quot;) <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">2: &#39;theme_text&#39; is deprecated.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Use &#39;element_text&#39; instead.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">See help(&quot;Deprecated&quot;) <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 5.45pt 4.1pt\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding:0in 0in 5.45pt 4.1pt\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">mpg3 &lt;- within(mpg2,{<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">  model &lt;- reorder(model,cty)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">  manufacturer &lt;-reorder(manufacturer, -cty)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">})<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">models &lt;- qplot(cty,model,data=mpg3)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">models + facet_grid(manufacturer ~ . , scales=&quot;free_Y&quot;,space=&quot;free&quot;)+ opts (strip.text.y=theme_text())<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">tried different tricks, to no avail!! Your help is appreciated.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:&quot;Vladimir Script&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:&quot;Vladimir Script&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Best Regards</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:&quot;Vladimir Script&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Ahmed</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">--\r\n<br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the ggplot2 mailing list.<br>\r\nPlease provide a reproducible example: <a href=\"https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792374104816000&amp;usg=AOvVaw02YvZYMDMc1oT0XLe79PRc\">\r\nhttps://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility</a><br>\r\n <br>\r\nTo post: email <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\nTo unsubscribe: email <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggplot2+u...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\nMore options: <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792374104816000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1MlbsXoK91N4juCXu__uBU\">http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div></div>"
    ]
