     "<div text=\"#000000\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\">\r\n    <blockquote type=\"cite\">\r\n      \r\n      \r\n      \r\n      <div>\r\n        <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Thanks Lori, it\r\n            did work; just had to add (angle=0) for the text\r\n            orientation.\r\n            <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n        <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">By the way, did\r\n            you try -</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">par(mfrow=c(2,2))-\r\n            with ggplot in Rstudio? It never worked for me!!\r\n            <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n        <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n        <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n        <div>\r\n          <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Best Regards</span><span><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n          <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Ahmed</span><span>\r\n            </span><span><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n          <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#333399\">.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n        <div>\r\n          <div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #b5c4df 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n            <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">\r\n                Lori Sutter [<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mailto:lsu...@vims.edu</a>]\r\n                <br>\r\n                <b>Sent:</b> Saturday, November 10, 2012 8:34 AM<br>\r\n                <b>To:</b> El-Tahtawy, Ahmed; <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\n                <b>Subject:</b> RE: Fac