     "<div bgcolor=\"white\" lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\"><div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #b5c4df 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:windowtext\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:windowtext\"> Ellen Pape [mailto:<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">Ellen...@ugent.be</a>]\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Monday, November 12, 2012 8:26 AM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> El-Tahtawy, Ahmed<br>\r\n<b>Cc:</b> Lori Sutter; <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> Re: Facet_grid<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi Ahmed,<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThat&#39;s because &quot;par&quot; commands don&#39;t work in ggplot2. If you want to plot multiple graphs in one window, you need to use the function &quot;grid.arrange&quot; from the library gridExtra..<br>\r\n<br>\r\nRegards,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><b><i>Ellen Pape (PhD student)</i></b>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nGhent University<br>\r\nMarine Biology Research Group<br>\r\nKrijgslaan 281, S8<br>\r\n9000 Ghent (Belgium) <br>\r\n<br>\r\nEmail: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">Ellen...@Ugent.be</a><br>\r\nTel: <a href=\"tel:+32%209%20264%2085%2023\" value=\"+3292648523\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">++ 32 (0)9 264 85 23</a><br>\r\nFax: <a href=\"tel:+32%209%20264%2085%2098\" value=\"+3292648598\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">++ 32 (0)9 264 85 98</a><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">On 12/11/2012 14:12, El-Tahtawy, Ahmed wrote:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<blockquote style=\"margin-top:5.0pt;margin-bottom:5.0pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Thanks Lori, it did work; just had to add (angle=0) for the text orientation.\r\n</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">By the way, did you try -</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">par(mfrow=c(2,2))- with ggplot in Rstudio? It never worked for me!!\r\n</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt\">Best Regards</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt\">Ahmed</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">\r\n</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#333399\">.</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #b5c4df 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"> Lori Sutter [<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mailto:lsu...@vims.edu</a>]\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Saturday, November 10, 2012 8:34 AM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> El-Tahtawy, Ahmed; <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> RE: Facet_grid</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Hi Ahmed-</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">With the latest version of ggplot2, opts() and theme_?() are out of date, or\r\n<i>deprecated</i>. Use the replacements the messages suggest: replace “opt” in your code with “theme”, and replace “theme_text” with “element_text”.  Should work…the book was based on earlier versions of the package.</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">cheers,</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Lori</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #b5c4df 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a> [<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mailto:ggp...@googlegroups.com</a>]\r\n<b>On Behalf Of </b>El-Tahtawy, Ahmed<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Friday, November 09, 2012 3:28 PM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> Facet_grid</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Dear all,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">The code in Page 123 of ggplot2 book gives me the following warning-<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">  <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"917\" style=\"width:688.1pt\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 5.45pt 4.1pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Warning messages:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">1: &#39;opts&#39; is deprecated.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Use &#39;theme&#39; instead.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">See help(&quot;Deprecated&quot;) <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">2: &#39;theme_text&#39; is deprecated.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Use &#39;element_text&#39; instead.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">See help(&quot;Deprecated&quot;) <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0in 0in 5.45pt 4.1pt\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding:0in 0in 5.45pt 4.1pt\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">mpg3 &lt;- within(mpg2,{<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">  model &lt;- reorder(model,cty)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">  manufacturer &lt;-reorder(manufacturer, -cty)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">})<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">models &lt;- qplot(cty,model,data=mpg3)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">models + facet_grid(manufacturer ~ . , scales=&quot;free_Y&quot;,space=&quot;free&quot;)+ opts (strip.text.y=theme_text())<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">tried different tricks, to no avail!! Your help is appreciated.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt\">Best Regards</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt\">Ahmed</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">\r\n</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman , serif&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">--\r\n<br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the ggplot2 mailing list.<br>\r\nPlease provide a reproducible example: <a href=\"https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792374104822000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ZVOr71_r9OC35M-i-ILUB\">\r\nhttps://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility</a><br>\r\n <br>\r\nTo post: email <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\nTo unsubscribe: email <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggplot2+u...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\nMore options: <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792374104822000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0umle9IfMxIcEzKJUb2vHh\">http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2</a></span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">--\r\n<br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the ggplot2 mailing list.<br>\r\nPlease provide a reproducible example: <a href=\"https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792374104822000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ZVOr71_r9OC35M-i-ILUB\">\r\nhttps://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility</a><br>\r\n <br>\r\nTo post: email <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\nTo unsubscribe: email <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggplot2+u...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\nMore options: <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792374104822000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0umle9IfMxIcEzKJUb2vHh\">http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div></div>"
